<title>USA: Whirlpool Corp Q3 net declines.</title>
<headline>Whirlpool Corp Q3 net declines.</headline>
<dateline>BENTON HARBOR, Mich. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.28		    $0.85</p>
<p> Net			 21,000		   64,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,200,000		2,154,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs			NA			 NA</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1996 net is after pretax charge of $30.0 million or $0.25 a share for restructuring Asian headquarters and North American refrigeration operation.</p>
<p>Q3 1996 operating income $40 million or $0.53 a share.  </p>
<p>Q3 1996 revenues include net sales of $2.16 billion vs $2.11 billion.</p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.48		    $2.55</p>
<p> Net			111,000		  191,000</p>
<p> Revs		   6,531,000		6,254,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs			NA			 NA</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month 1996 results are after $30 million in restructuring costs. Excluding this charge, nine-month operating earnings were $130 million, or $1.73 a share.</p>
<p>Nine-month 1996 revenues include net sales of $6.40 billion vs $6.12 billion.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
